    55	/// The schema comes from the first file; every other file must agree on column names
    56	/// (ASCII case-insensitive, matching StarRocks name resolution) and types. Positional
    57	/// slot fields (id/slot_idx/column_pos) are per-file bookkeeping and are not compared.
